Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Han free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:07.66,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,355.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,5700,6900)}Episode 23
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:07.66,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.906,550.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,5700,6900)}Fall of Yuán Shào
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:12.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the seventh year of the Jiàn'ān era,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:12.50,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,202 CE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:17.72,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo invaded Yuán Shào, who, in his stress, died.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:23.10,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Before his death, he disinherited his eldest son, Yuán Tán, for his youngest son, Yuán Shàng.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:26.78,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Thus he provoked the struggle between Yuan Tan and Yuan Shang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:35.65,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang besieged Yuan Tan, compelling him to send Xīn Pí to negotiate his surrender with Cáo Cāo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.68,0:00:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Zuǒzhì, I'm thinking of aiding you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:53.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but I'm not sure if Yuan Tan's surrender is sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}It is not sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Oh? Then it is deceit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}It is no deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.14,0:01:12.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, you needn't ask his sincerity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You only need to ponder their state.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yuan Shao has been losing for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12}His military is exhausted, \Nand his advisors executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His sons quarrel, his state now divided in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Meanwhile famine and disasters plague the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Both the wise and simple know this is \NHeaven itself calling to end the Yuán clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now Your Excellency is attacking Jì Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:46.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If Yuan Shang does not reinforce Jì Province, then he would lose his base.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But if he does reinforce it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}then Yuan Tan would pursue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With your esteemed might, you should strike his fatigued troops
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}like a wind sweeping through autumn leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:02:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The realm's greatest bane is in Hebei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Pacify Hebei to extend your dominance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:13.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12}And if you please sir... \NA gift of wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I regret not meeting you sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:34.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The realm's greatest bane is in Hebei."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Pacify Hebei to extend my dominance."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With you as his envoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}even if his surrender is deceit, he will surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:55.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(296.119,488.182)}Xīn Pí\NStyled: Zuǒzhì
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(323.412,497.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1680,1940)}Yuán Tán\NStyled: Xiǎnsī
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This subject, Yuan Tan, \Npays his respects to the Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are the two generals behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lǚ Kuàng and Lǚ Xiáng pay their respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you two consider each other blood brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am aware you two were \NYuan Shang's subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why are you surrendering now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Chancellor, {\bord12}Yuan Shang knows you came to rescue me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and has fled to Jì Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He ordered those two generals to engage me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but I had told them on the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.86,0:04:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"When my father was alive, \NI never treated you with disrespect."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Now why follow my brother and seek my defeat?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When they heard reason, they submitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I again told them,\N"Surrender not to me, but to Chancellor Cao."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Thus these two have come \Nand await your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When your father was still alive, \Ndespite all the humiliations,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.30,0:05:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he never once bowed to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Though you two pity the Yuan clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}you cannot stand their brothers' conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now I will name you as marquises!\NYou will accompany my army!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare ask another question. When do we attack Jì Province and Yuan Shang?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our supplies are exhausted\N and shipment is treacherous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You can stay at Píngyuán while I set camp at Lìyáng.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After we clear the supply lines, we will advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You two are now his lackeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you still doing here!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:42.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang had Yǐn Kǎi guard Fort Máo to maintain supply lines from Shăngdăng!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The vanguard has already set up camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang had Jǔ Kù hold Hándān City, \Nleaving Shěn Pèi and Chén Lín to guard Ji Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Troops assaulted Pingyuan overnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Yuan Shang is really determined to defeat Yuan Tan and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang's army is pressing \Ndown on Pingyuan! Yuan Tan pleads great danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He came so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Xu You has come back from Xuchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Yuan Shang has already sent troops to attack Yuan Tan,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,yet you still wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you expecting for lightning to strike the two Yuans?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all within my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll advance your forces to attack Ji Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will lead an attack to Fort Mao, then Handan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll meet before the walls of Jì Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.78,0:08:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare at third watch, we move out at daybreak. \NJi Province will be ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So there is a lightning strike...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:19.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo marched his army and crushed Yuan Shang,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:24.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,who had to send the Overseer of Yù Province, Yin Kui, \Nover to Cáo Cāo's side to negotiate surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang's army is decimated, they've fled for 50 {\i1}li.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the Overseer of Yù Province, Yin Kui, is here under Yuan Shang's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He has come in Yuan Shang's stead to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the elder brother sent someone to surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and now, the little brother sends someone to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhāng Liáo. Xú Huǎng.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang knows I've granted his surrender, he'll be unprepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.54,0:09:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You two will raid their base at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Leave them not a moment of respite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Whether Yuan Shang is dead or alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,At dawn, I will receive his surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.82,0:09:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Surrender"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we attacked their camp as you wished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang abandoned all his belongings and fled to Zhōngshān.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Officers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We will assault Jì Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:36.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,1700,2180)}{\pos(963.099,510.09)}Shěn Pèi \NStyled: Zhēngnán
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shěn Pèi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lord Yuan Shang has fled to Zhōngshān in defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jì Province is outmatched, your end is near!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not surrender now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you await the waters \Nof the Zhang River flooding your city?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Uncle, you've been standing here for two days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You should take rest in the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:14.22,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Your subject, Yuán Tán, pays \Nhis respects to the Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When our former lord reigned, \NHebei was a force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now, our lord has passed,\N and Yuan Tan surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yuan Shang was going to save our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet now he's fleeing to Zhōngshān, \Nbefore even setting foot inside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sir, we have seized all eighty of\N Xīn Pí's kinsmen, young and old!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ji Province is about to fall! It's only a matter of time, so why not surrender now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please spare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If everyone in the city remains loyal to Shen Pei, then you will all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If any of you kills Shen Pei and delivers the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,you'll be a hero for your people, rewarded as such!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After entering the city, \NChancellor Cao will award you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please spare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please spare us, sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If any of you that kills Shen Pei and delivers the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.98,0:12:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,you'll be a hero for your people, rewarded as such!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After entering the city, \NChancellor Cao will award you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shouting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When we enter Jì Province, do not harm any members of the Yuán clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.26,0:13:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who surrenders, \Nsoldier or civilian, shall be spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.30,0:13:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, if you don't trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:14:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can ask Mister Chén to relieve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly keep going on like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.34,0:14:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, look! General Xú has captured Shěn Pèi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:04.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,1700,2180)\pos(975.028,494.49)} Guō Jiā \NStyled: Fèngxiào
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Xú, please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You pathetic, murdering mongrel! Look where you are now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mongrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull him up, bring him to see the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look where you are now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.82,0:16:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shen Pei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who opened your gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your nephew, Shěn Róng!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My nephew swore to live and die with the city. Thus, when the city fell,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.38,0:17:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he was already a step \Nahead of me and died for his nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I arrived here yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why were there so many archers on the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I only regret it was too few!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are loyal to the Yuan clan. You only did what you had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you surrender now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:17:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire family was murdered by this bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I've flogged him 800 times,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it'd never be enough to quell my hatred! Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In life, I serve as Yuán clan's vassal. \NIn death, I will serve as Yuan clan's ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like you lot, hypocrites full of treason and fraud!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.74,0:18:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, kill me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll respect your wishes. Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord is in the north, and I do not wish to die facing the south!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.18,0:18:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll bury you north of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Much obliged!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When your elder brother, Xīn Píng, received news of your surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he died in shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He wished on his deathbed\N that the day the city fell,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I would have all eighty of your kin executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now they're with Xīn Píng, just as he wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}There are so many loyal men in Hebei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}A pity the Yuan clan could not use them to their fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Had they done so, how could I have dared to eye this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:20:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Isn't that Chén Lín? Chén Kǒngzhāng?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When Yuan Shao was preparing his armies to attack me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}you had composed a Denunciation Essay, \Ncalling for an expedition against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In it, you listed my crimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but why insult even my father and grandfather!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The arrow was on the bowstring, I had to shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Execute him! Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"An arrow that had to be shot," eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me your essay tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.14,0:20:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You will follow me to Yuan Shao's tomb, to pay tribute to Běnchū.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares to enter Yuan Mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,without my knowledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,News, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Insolent whelp, why aren't you coming down?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:46.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,1700,2180)\pos(960.361,490.541)}Cáo Pī \NStyled: Zǐhuán
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know of my orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you defy them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:22:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son knows it's wrong, \Nbut I ask my father to meet someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet with whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.58,0:22:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Yuán Xī's wife, Lady Zhēn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:36.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,1100,1180)\pos(980.41,484.981)}Lady Zhēn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care, do not harm them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.64,0:22:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.78,0:22:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Outsiders cannot protect our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are willing to offer Lady Zhen as a wife for your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.18,0:23:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,An outsider cannot protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, to speak thusly?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.34,0:23:15.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2000,3180)\pos(981.756,482.264)}Lady Liu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the wife of Yuan Shao, Lady Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.70,0:23:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you dress like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.14,0:23:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.22,0:23:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this is Yuan Běnchū's wife, \Nfine silks and grain will be bestowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.82,0:23:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.22,0:23:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.30,0:23:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please bestow to me... the mercy of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.86,0:24:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, a most fitting wife for my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.14,0:24:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Xǔ, you worked so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.46,0:24:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think any of you could enter the city without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.58,0:24:41.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1900,2220)\pos(323.809,453.736)}Xŭ Chŭ\NStyled: Zhòngkāng
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.06,0:24:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We put our lives at risk\N innumerable times to capture this city!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.50,0:24:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yet you dare to boast!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.26,0:24:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Baseborn ignoramuses, \Nwhat do you have to yap for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.70,0:25:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Xǔ Yōu was too impudent, so I had to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.94,0:25:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyuan and I were old friends, and \Nhe humored me often. Why kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General Xǔ.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.26,0:25:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please bury Ziyuan with full honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.10,0:25:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Long ago, Běnchū and I commanded armies together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.18,0:25:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Běnchū once asked me:
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.06,0:25:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If matters go awry, where would you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.94,0:26:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I asked him, "Friend, what are you saying?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.86,0:26:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Běnchū said:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.36,0:26:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"To my south cuts a river, \Nto the north blocks lands of Yān and Dài,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.54,0:26:07.66,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Yān and Dài are ancient names for lands situated in modern-day Hebei and Liaoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.10,0:26:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}along with the tribes of the steppes."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.34,0:26:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If I marched south to conquer, would I succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.10,0:26:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I replied:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.66,0:26:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I entrust the wisdom and power of all beneath the heavens,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.94,0:26:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}with virtue on our side, nothing could stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.06,0:26:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That, I did say before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.06,0:26:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yet now, Běnchū is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.58,0:26:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and my lament cannot cease!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.58,0:27:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The people of Hebei have faced fire and steel. Hence, this year their burden of tax will be cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.74,0:27:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Xu Chu?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.66,0:27:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.66,0:27:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the headstones of Ju Shou, Shen Pei, \NXīn Píng, and other gentlemen from Hebei prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.18,0:27:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Tan, Yuan Shang, \Nand Yuan Xi only cared of killing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.06,0:27:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They are sons most unfilial!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.02,0:27:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They may still live, but only barely. \NTheir end will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.02,0:27:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáo Hóng, place headstones for them as well. \NThey shall be with their father.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.30,0:27:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chen Lin?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.50,0:27:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.26,0:27:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take out that Denunciation Essay you wrote back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.34,0:28:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.78,0:28:11.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,4000,4420)\pos(966.195,441.51)}Chén Lín\NStyled: Kǒngzhāng
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}{\i1}The Ducal Minister of Works, Cáo Cāo,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.26,0:28:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}his grandfather Cáo Teng,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.26,0:28:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}with the eunuchs, violated the state with depravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.58,0:28:53.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His father, Cáo Song, the eunuch-adopted groveler,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.26,0:28:58.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}with his venal false-name, now a briber of the powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.66,0:29:03.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Cāo is heir to the ugly, his obscenity inherent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.70,0:29:06.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Wicked and vile, loves only to ravage...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.10,0:29:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.82,0:29:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please make him stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.62,0:29:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Read it! Why stop it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.38,0:29:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When this essay was spread to Xǔdū,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.18,0:29:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I suffered migraines and laid ill in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.90,0:29:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Reading it opened my senses, my hairs stood on end;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.06,0:29:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}in a cold sweat, my migraines were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.06,0:29:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Hence could I lead a grand army \Nto conquer Liyang, to repel Yuan Shao,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.06,0:29:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and fight him to the last man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.06,0:29:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Truly, an essay written like an arrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.26,0:29:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With this arrow loosed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.98,0:30:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}it made corpses of so many able men on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.58,0:30:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}their souls now in heaven's bosom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.18,0:30:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If I, Cáo Cāo, cannot receive this arrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.46,0:30:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}how could those able men sleep in the earth and rest beneath the meadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.58,0:30:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}like stars shining, these words are radiant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.26,0:30:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If this text won't be read...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.22,0:30:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}... how shall I return this debt of blood to the Heavens!?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.02,0:30:39.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A war council set up against tyranny,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.62,0:30:43.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}with drawn swords and beating drums, an order sent out to the East,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.94,0:30:48.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}to gather all heroes, and absolve their past sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.58,0:30:52.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Thus would there be unity with Cáo Cāo,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.60,0:30:57.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and ally with his ranks. \NWith his skills like hunting-hounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.38,0:31:02.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}would tooth and nail be used. \NYet Cāo domineers in arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.44,0:31:06.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Abusing men and their nation, \Npoisoning the people and their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.02,0:31:11.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Look through all the annals, \Nof all the consuls most corrupt,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.78,0:31:15.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}most gluttonous and hateful, \Nthere stands Cāo worst of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.26,0:31:19.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Those who bring Cáo Cāo's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.06,0:31:23.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}will be given lands of five thousand households, and a reward of fifty million!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.00,0:31:31.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Announcing to all under heaven, let all men know of the calamity that befell our holy dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.96,0:31:33.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Thus saith the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.58,0:31:36.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After Cáo Cāo conquered Jì Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.18,0:31:40.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,, the Yuan brothers continued to war with each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.78,0:31:44.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,causing Yuan Shang to flee to Yōu Province to join with Yuan Xi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.58,0:31:48.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yuan Tan had surrendered, \Nyet still wished to retake Jì Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.78,0:31:52.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo was furious and began a war against Yuan Tan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.10,0:31:55.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yuan Tan attempted to surrender to Cáo Cāo again, but was refused,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.50,0:31:58.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and was finally killed by Cao Hong in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.70,0:32:03.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Soon, Cáo Cāo sent his troops north to capture Yōu and Bìng Provinces,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.46,0:32:07.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,then battled the Wuhuan tribes in the west, in pursuit of Yuan Shang and Yuan Xi
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.70,0:32:11.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and fought the final battle to pacify the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.82,0:32:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fèngxiào! \N- Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.22,0:32:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You had to go through so much just so we could pacify the desert, and now carry on with illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.06,0:32:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can I forgive myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.30,0:32:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor... Your grace...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.86,0:32:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}... My life can't repay even a fraction of your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.06,0:32:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Fengxiao, in these harsh lands,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.86,0:33:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}if I wanted to return home, how does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.30,0:33:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Armies live on swift action.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.10,0:33:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We've traveled a thousand {\i1}li{\i0} to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.70,0:33:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but we're lacking in speed due to our heavy supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.78,0:33:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We should send light troops to move out and cover ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.26,0:33:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Fengxiao, your words are pertinent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.96,0:33:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Then... I will lead veteran troops to advance ahead, through the back road.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.02,0:33:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Let the remaining army return and await further orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.82,0:33:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Fengxiao...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.26,0:33:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You should return with them to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.14,0:33:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.46,0:33:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will meet again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.10,0:34:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.70,0:34:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.22,0:34:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The desert is hard to pass through. You need a guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.22,0:34:46.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After Cáo Cāo confronted Yuan Shang and Yuan Xi in Bailang Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.34,0:34:51.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Tàdùn of the Wuhuan lead his horsemen on the unwitting enemy force.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.90,0:34:55.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the ensuing onslaught, Tàdùn was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.70,0:35:00.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang and Yuan Xi had to retreat with their few remaining cavalry to Liáodōng.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.46,0:35:05.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When Cáo Cāo returned to his lands,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.78,0:35:10.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Guo Jia had already passed away, at the age of 38.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.26,0:35:13.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,His service lasted for eleven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.38,0:36:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.06,0:36:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.10,0:36:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor has mourned for so long here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.70,0:36:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We worry for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.70,0:36:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shang and Yuan Xi have fled to Liáodōng. It will be hard to reach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.86,0:36:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why not return to the capital of Xǔ?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.86,0:36:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stay too long, there's a risk Liú Biǎo in Jīng Province might grow unruly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.38,0:36:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, a moment please. This won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.18,0:36:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We can return once the Yuan brothers' heads have been delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.14,0:37:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.94,0:37:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.46,0:37:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.22,0:37:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gōngsūn Kāng {\i0}of Liaodong has sent the heads of Yuan Shang and Yuan Xi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.98,0:37:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What? How...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.22,0:37:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as Fengxiao predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.10,0:37:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.74,0:37:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Yuan Xi and Yuan Shang will flee to Liaodong."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.70,0:38:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Sire should not send troops to follow."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.18,0:38:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Gōngsūn Kāng has feared the unity of the Yuan clan, thus will be suspicious of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.02,0:38:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Were you to use force and haste, they will match it in unity.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.90,0:38:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But if you stalled, Gongsun Kang and the Yuans...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.62,0:38:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}They will conspire against one another, as this is their nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.70,0:38:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.06,0:38:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When I returned, Fengxiao's aide gave this letter to me and said:
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.06,0:38:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}“If Chancellor were to follow the letter..."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.94,0:38:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The matter of Liaodong will be solved."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.26,0:39:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We are all veterans with many years behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.14,0:39:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}But Fengxiao was youngest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.58,0:39:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He was to be my confidant.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.52,0:39:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yet he was taken so soon, I cannot but grieve.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:24.70,0:39:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Fengxiao is dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.92,0:39:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}O Death, have you seized too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.42,0:39:53.38,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Gazing at Dark-Blue Sea" {\fnYu Gothic\fs22}(观沧海){\fn\fs}\Nby Cáo Cāo
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.42,0:39:53.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Rode east to Mount Jieshi, \NI gazed at dark blue sea.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.66,0:40:01.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Waters gently dancing,\N mountain islands tower.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:02.74,0:40:07.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The trees there growing dense, \Nyet grasses still so lush.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:08.50,0:40:13.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Winds of autumn blowing cold, \Nas waves are surging forth.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:14.82,0:40:18.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}The tours of Sun and Moon, \Nlike rising from within.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:18.42,0:40:22.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}Band of stars so splendid,\N like bursting from within.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:23.82,0:40:29.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord10.909}O to be so blessed! \NI sing, I shout my ambition!
Comment: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You all!
Comment: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:11.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(450.32,265.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1680,2060)}Screenwriter:\NZhu Yaoping
Comment: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1013.902,300)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,1680,2180)}Director:\NShen Haofang

